    LLM: "Learn hand rankings (GwangTtaeng, Ttaeng, Geut, MangTong) and when to fold weak hands to limit losses.\n\nBet early with strong hands (Ttaeng or higher) to pressure opponents; fold weak hands early; watch opponents' betting patterns to infer hand strength.\n\nKnow special hands (47 Amhaeng Eosa, 37 Ttaeng Jabi) and when they apply; balance bluffing with value betting; exploit opponents who call or raise too often.",
